OL,3,GNEWSATeacher guilty of indecent
OL,4,Aassaults against two pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chemistry teacher has been found
OL,7,Fguilty of indecently assaulting two
OL,8,Fteenage pupils at an all-boys school in
OL,9,Fthe late 1980s.
OL,11,FSally-Anne Bowen, who taught at
OL,12,FChrist's College in Finchley, north
OL,13,FLondon, assaulted the boys when they
OL,14,Fwere aged around 14 to 15 and she was
OL,15,Fin her mid-20s.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, a jury at Harrow Crown
OL,18,FCourt found the 65-year-old guilty of
OL,19,Fseven counts of indecent assault after
OL,20,Fdeliberating for six hours and 29
OL,21,Fminutes.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
