OL,5,
OL,6,FOne complainant told the court he had
OL,7,Fsex with the teacher "about 20 or 30
OL,8,Ftimes" over several months. He said he
OL,9,Fvisited her at home, considered her his
OL,10,Fgirlfriend and had fallen in love with
OL,11,Fher.
